   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Is there an easy way to pass a zero length vector into an RStan model? For example:<br><br></div>data {<br></div>  int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;<br></div>  vector[N] y;<br><div><div><div>}<br>...<br><br>\r\n<br><br><div><br><br><br>Daniel<br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "zKhyeLRBz40J",
   "from": "Ben Goodrich",
   "author": "743bbacc59f4b25f",
   "date": "2014-06-13T04:14:55Z",
   "subject": "Re: RStan: zero length vectors",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not sure it will work, but you can do<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(...,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mode </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;double&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><br>On Thursday, June 12, 2014 11:56:57 PM UTC-4, Daniel Lee wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Is there an easy way to pass a zero length vector into an RStan model? For example:<br><br></div>data {<br></div>  int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;<br></div>  vector[N] y;<br><div><div><div>}<br>...<br><br>\r\n<br><br><div><br><br><br>Daniel<br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
