   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Doesn&#39;t work. Looks like we can&#39;t do it from the command line either. I think this is an issue.<br><br>We should be able to sample from the prior if we give no data in something like the bernoulli model.<br>\r\n</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
